eigenfluid-navier
  C++17 / Vulkan research: continuous 3D incompressible Navier-Stokes using
  divergence-free Laplacian eigenfunctions and sparse modal interactions.
  Goal: realistic deforming liquids at 60 FPS on baseline Apple M1 hardware.
  papers/       references and full-text links
  research.md   method, limitations and validation plan
